I disagree from a pacifist point of view -- liches are acceptable pets
at the mine town / Sokoban stage of the game, but they don't deal
enough damage with their cold attack once you're well into the
midgame. Besides, they will kill off the shopkeepers, priests, and
foocubi you still need for other purposes, they will constantly get in
your way, you can't keep them leashed, and you risk waking up Rodney
before you're prepared to deal with his resurrections.


